  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exploring cultural and historical memory of the nation - SV Belarus</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Sk&#xfa;manie kult&#xfa;rno-historickej pam&#xe4;te n&#xe1;roda -&#x160;N Bielorusko</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The study visit included:&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; meetings with academic members of the Department of Cultural Heritage of Constantine and Methodius in Nitra and performance and focus of individual workplaces&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; working meetings with members of the Institute with the planned lectures:&lt;br /&gt;- Methodological aspects of constructing cultural and historical memory&lt;br /&gt;- Humanities Education - Space Transformation cultural and historical memory in practice&lt;br /&gt;- The post-Soviet &quot;religious boom&quot; as a massive turn for the historical memory&lt;br /&gt;- Transformation of philosophical disciplines in post-socialist countries - comparative analysis&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; visit Diocesan Library, which is considered one of the most important collections of old books in Slovakia, interview with the head of Diocesan Library for preservation of rare documents&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; visit catholic seminary of St. Gorazd&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; visit to the Holocaust Museum in Sered&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; synagogue visit&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&#x160;tudijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva obsahovala:&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; stretnutia s akademick&#xfd;mi &#x10d;lenmi &#xda;stavu kult&#xfa;rneho dedi&#x10d;stva Kon&#x161;tant&#xed;na a Metoda v Nitre a predstavenie &#x10d;innosti a z&#xe1;merov jednotliv&#xfd;ch pracov&#xed;sk&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; pracovn&#xe9; stretnutia s &#x10d;lenmi &#xda;stavu s pl&#xe1;novan&#xfd;mi predn&#xe1;&#x161;kami: &lt;br /&gt;- Metodologick&#xe9; aspekty kon&#x161;truovania kult&#xfa;rno-historickej pam&#xe4;ti&lt;br /&gt;- Humanitn&#xe9; vzdel&#xe1;vanie - priestor pre transform&#xe1;ciu kult&#xfa;rno-historickej pam&#xe4;ti do praxe&lt;br /&gt;- Postsovietsky &#x201c;n&#xe1;bo&#x17e;ensk&#xfd; boom&#x201d; ako masov&#xfd; obrat k historickej pam&#xe4;ti&lt;br /&gt;- Transform&#xe1;cia filozofick&#xfd;ch discipl&#xed;n v postsocialistick&#xfd;ch &#x161;t&#xe1;toch &#x2013; porovn&#xe1;vacia anal&#xfd;za&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva Diec&#xe9;znej kni&#x17e;nici , ktor&#xe1; sa poklad&#xe1; za jednu z najv&#xfd;znamnej&#x161;&#xed;ch zbierok star&#xfd;ch kn&#xed;h na Slovensku, rozhovor s ved&#xfa;cim Diec&#xe9;znej kni&#x17e;nice o uchov&#xe1;van&#xed; vz&#xe1;cnych dokumentov&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva K&#x148;azsk&#xe9;ho semin&#xe1;ra sv. Gorazda&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva M&#xfa;zea holokaustu v Seredi&lt;br /&gt;&#x25cf; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva synag&#xf3;gy&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
